    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's an expanded version of the \"Getting Started\" guide:\n\n**Introduction**\n----------------\n\nThe CloudScale API allows you to easily integrate cloud-based services into your applications. This guide provides a structured approach to setting up a basic REST API integration.\n\n**Prerequisites**\n----------------\n\n* Create a CloudScale account and obtain an API key.\n* Choose a programming language that supports HTTP requests (e.g., Python, Node.js, Java).\n\n**Step 1: Obtain an API Key**\n-----------------------------\n\nTo integrate with the CloudScale API, you need to obtain an API key. You can do this by:\n\n* Logging into your CloudScale account\n* Clicking on the \"API Keys\" tab\n* Generating a new API key (an email and password will be sent to you for authentication purposes)\n* Copying and storing the API key securely\n\n**Step 2: Prepare Your Environment**\n-------------------------------------\n\n* Install the HTTP client library for your chosen programming language (e.g., `requests` for Python, `axios` for Node.js).\n* Choose a suitable base URL for your API request (e.g., `https://apis.clouddesking.com/v1/your-service`).\n\n**Step 3: Authenticate with the API**",
